    "MissionGiver": "Red Wind Linehaul",
    "Title": "Red Wind Dangerous Cargo Recovery",
    "TitleKey": "RedWind_RecoverCargo_VeryHard_Title",
    "Description": "RED WIND LINEHAUL\n'YOUR GOODS IN GOOD HANDS'\n----------------------------\n\nPutting out a call for a highly skilled pilot who can recover our client\u2019s cargo. Please only accept this contract if you have experience dealing with extremely hostile situations involving multiple combatants. Additional crew members and a <EM4>heavy-duty tractor beam</EM4> are highly recommended.\n\nRECOVERY LOCATION\n     \u00b7 <EM4>~mission(Location|Address)</EM4>\n\nDROP OFF LOCATION\n     \u00b7 Freight elevator at <EM4>~mission(Destination|Address)</EM4>\n\nThe cargo should be in the bay of the abandoned ship. The client has already expressed frustration regarding the cargo\u2019s delay so please work quickly and efficiently.\n\nBE RESILIENT \u2013 Life is hard and sometimes you have to roll with the punches. Keep going and don\u2019t let it bring you down.",
    "DescriptionKey": "RedWind_RecoverCargo_VeryHard_Description",
    "DisplayDescription": "RED WIND LINEHAUL\n'YOUR GOODS IN GOOD HANDS'\n----------------------------\n\nPutting out a call for a highly skilled pilot who can recover our client\u2019s cargo. Please only accept this contract if you have experience dealing with extremely hostile situations involving multiple combatants. Additional crew members and a <EM4>heavy-duty tractor beam</EM4> are highly recommended.\n\nRECOVERY LOCATION\n     \u00b7 <EM4>[Location|Address]</EM4>\n\nDROP OFF LOCATION\n     \u00b7 Freight elevator at <EM4>[Destination|Address]</EM4>\n\nThe cargo should be in the bay of the abandoned ship. The client has already expressed frustration regarding the cargo\u2019s delay so please work quickly and efficiently.\n\nBE RESILIENT \u2013 Life is hard and sometimes you have to roll with the punches. Keep going and don\u2019t let it bring you down.",
